function secondaryDevice(){var m=selectedDevice==='m5',name=m?'圆圆':'豆豆',owner=m?'林的家':'周的家',locationName=m?'书桌':'书房';return '<div class="breadcrumbs"><a href="#/devices">设备列表</a>'+I('chevron')+name+'</div>'+head(name,owner+' / '+locationName+' · '+(m?'M5':'微雪')+' ESP32-S3')+'<section class="panel mb"><div class="device-hero"><div class="device-pic">'+U.face('neutral')+'</div><div><h2>'+name+'</h2><p class="muted small">'+owner+' · '+locationName+'</p></div></div></section><div class="tabs">'+['概况','对话','设置','能力','诊断'].map(function(t){return '<button class="tab '+(deviceTab===t?'active':'')+'" data-device-tab="'+t+'">'+t+'</button>';}).join('')+'</div>'+panel(deviceTab,deviceTab==='概况'?D([['所属家庭',owner],['设备位置',locationName],['硬件型号',(m?'M5':'微雪')+' ESP32-S3'],['最近连接',m?'今天 11:12':'昨天 20:16'],['网络状态','未持续上报'],['电量','未知']]):deviceTab==='对话'?(m?'<a href="#/conversations" data-chat="weather" class="between"><span>周末适合去公园吗</span>'+I('chevron')+'</a>':U.empty('聊天正文需要授权','当前演示账号没有这台设备的正文访问权限。',btn('申请访问','request-access','soft'))):deviceTab==='能力'?'<p class="small">支持能力需要根据这台设备的实际协商信息展示。</p>'+N('设备型号相同不代表全部功能都已现场验收。','info'):deviceTab==='设置'?N('当前预览中此设备设置为只读。可返回设备列表，打开客厅机器人查看完整设置表单。','info'):D([['语音活动','当前无语音连接'],['最近事件','设备会话已结束'],['播放证据','按具体会话查看'],['原始录音','未保存']])) ;}
function settingsForm(){return '<section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><h2>设备资料与偏好</h2>'+B('保存仅影响原型','orange')+'</div><form id="device-settings"><div class="form-grid"><div class="form-field"><label for="robot-name">机器人名称</label><input class="field" id="robot-name" name="name" maxlength="20" required value="'+e(U.state.name)+'"><small>正式接入后对新会话生效；不改变离线唤醒词。</small></div><div class="form-field"><label for="robot-location">放置位置</label><input class="field" id="robot-location" value="客厅"><small>帮助家庭成员识别设备。</small></div><div class="form-field"><label for="robot-volume">音量 <output id="volume-value">'+U.state.volume+'%</output></label><input type="range" id="robot-volume" name="volume" min="0" max="100" value="'+U.state.volume+'" data-range="volume-value"><small>正式控制需收到设备回读才显示成功。</small></div><div class="form-field"><label for="robot-brightness">屏幕亮度 <output id="brightness-value">'+U.state.brightness+'%</output></label><input type="range" id="robot-brightness" name="brightness" min="0" max="100" value="'+U.state.brightness+'" data-range="brightness-value"><small>当前示例不连接机器人。</small></div></div><div class="divider"></div><div class="between"><span class="muted small">当前硬件：微雪 ESP32-S3</span><button class="btn primary" type="submit">保存示例配置</button></div><p class="field-error" id="settings-error"></p></form></section>';}
function chatMessages(s,mobile){var messages=s.id==='run'?[['user','我今天跑完了第一公里！','14:32:10'],['assistant','太棒了！从第一步到第一公里，你已经迈出了很棒的一步。今天感觉怎么样？','14:32:13'],['user','腿有一点酸，运动后应该怎么放松？','14:33:02'],['assistant','可以先慢走两三分钟，让呼吸慢慢平稳下来。然后轻轻拉伸小腿和大腿，动作不要太用力。','14:33:06']]:s.id==='story'?[['user','给我讲一个小狐狸的睡前故事吧。','11:06:03'],['assistant','小狐狸住在森林边的一间小木屋里。每天晚上，它都会趴在窗边，等月亮升起来。','11:06:07'],['user','月亮为什么有时是弯的？','11:06:15'],['assistant','因为我们看到的月亮被太阳照亮的部分在变化，所以它有时像弯弯的小船，有时又像圆圆的盘子。','11:06:19']]:s.id==='weather'?[['user','周末天气怎么样，适合去公园吗？','09:18:06'],['assistant','示例天气查询显示，周末白天多云，适合到公园走走。出门前再看一次最新预报，带上水就好。','09:18:10']]:[['user','我想晚饭后出去走一走。','19:42:01'],['assistant','可以先休息一会儿，再找一条熟悉、平坦的路线慢走。不用追求距离，走得舒服最重要。','19:42:05']];return '<div class="chat-date">'+s.date+' · '+s.time+' 开始</div>'+messages.map(function(m,idx){var isUser=m[0]==='user',interrupted=s.id==='story'&&idx===1;return '<div class="message '+(isUser?'user':'assistant')+'"><span class="avatar '+(isUser?'teal':'')+'">'+(isUser?'人':I('chick'))+'</span><div class="message-content"><div class="message-label">'+(isUser?'用户 · 说话人未识别':e(U.state.name))+' <span style="margin-left:6px">'+m[2]+'</span></div><div class="bubble" '+(!mobile?'data-action="round-detail" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="查看本轮详情"':'')+'>'+e(m[1])+'</div><div class="message-receipt">'+I(isUser?'check':interrupted?'clock':'check')+(isUser?'最终转写 · 已保存':interrupted?'已播放部分 · 被打断':'实际已播完 · 已保存')+(!isUser?' '+B(interrupted?'放松':'开心',interrupted?'':'orange'):'')+'</div>'+(!isUser&&interrupted?'<details class="draft"><summary>查看生成但未播放的内容</summary><p>这天晚上，小狐狸发现月亮似乎比昨天更圆了一些……</p><p class="small">此部分没有播放证据，不计入用户已听内容。</p></details>':'')+'</div></div>';}).join('');}
function conversations(){var s=U.sessions.find(function(x){return x.id===chatId;})||U.sessions[0];var filtered=U.sessions.filter(function(x){return (!chatSearch||(x.title+x.summary+x.device).includes(chatSearch))&&(chatDeviceSel==='全部设备'||(x.device==='团团'?U.state.name:x.device)===chatDeviceSel)&&(chatPeriodSel==='最近7天'||x.date===chatPeriodSel);});if(filtered.length&&!filtered.some(function(x){return x.id===s.id;})){s=filtered[0];chatId=s.id;}var stateBody='';if(chatState==='empty'||!filtered.length)stateBody=U.empty('没有找到聊天','试试其他关键词，或切换家庭和时间范围。',btn('清除筛选','reset-chat','soft'));if(chatState==='sync')stateBody=U.empty('正在同步聊天记录','语音记录已产生，页面索引尚在同步。稍后刷新即可查看。',btn('刷新状态','chat-normal','','refresh'));if(chatState==='error')stateBody=U.empty('这一轮记录保存失败','已识别内容不等于已经保存。查看错误信息或重试同步。',btn('查看失败详情','record-error','danger'));if(chatState==='denied')stateBody=U.empty('正文需要访问授权','你可以查看会话概况。聊天正文需要家庭管理员授权。',btn('申请访问','request-access','soft','lock'));var clockBase=s.id==='story'?'11:06':s.id==='weather'?'09:18':s.id==='dinner'?'19:42':'14:33';var normal='<div class="conversation-layout"><aside class="conversation-list"><div class="conversation-list-head"><div class="between"><h3>聊天会话</h3><span class="muted small">'+filtered.length+' 段</span></div><div class="search">'+I('search')+'<input id="chat-filter" aria-label="搜索聊天会话" placeholder="搜索聊天内容…" value="'+e(chatSearch)+'"></div></div><div class="conversation-items">'+filtered.map(function(x){return '<button class="conversation-item '+(s.id===x.id?'active':'')+'" data-chat="'+x.id+'"><div class="between"><small>'+x.date+' '+x.time+'</small>'+B(x.status,x.type)+'</div><h3>'+x.title+'</h3><p>'+x.summary+'</p><div class="between" style="margin-top:10px"><small>'+e(x.device)+' · '+x.rounds+'轮</small><small>'+x.duration+'</small></div></button>';}).join('')+'</div></aside><section class="chat-pane"><div class="chat-head"><div class="between"><h2>'+s.title+'</h2><button class="btn flat icon-only" data-action="conversation-more" aria-label="聊天操作">'+I('more')+'</button></div><div class="chat-meta"><span>林的家 / '+e(U.state.name)+'</span><span>·</span><span>'+s.rounds+'轮有效交流</span><span>·</span>'+B('仅文字记录')+'</div></div><div class="chat-messages">'+chatMessages(s,false)+'</div><div class="chat-footer">'+I('shield')+'示例正文 · 原音未保存，不提供录音回放</div></section><aside class="detail-pane"><div><h3>聊天概况</h3>'+D([['保存状态',B('已保存','green')],['结束方式',s.end],['会话分段','30分钟无有效交互'],['实际播放',s.id==='story'?'1轮中断，其余完成':'示例轮次已完成'],['归档摘要',B('待开发')]])+'<div class="divider"></div><h3>本轮表达</h3><div class="flex">'+U.face(s.id==='story'?'relaxed':'happy')+'<div><strong>'+s.emotion+'</strong><p class="muted" style="font-size:10px;margin-top:5px">情绪随实际播放生效</p></div></div></div><div><h3>记录过程</h3><div class="event-line"><span class="dot"></span>收到音频<time>'+clockBase+':02</time></div><div class="event-line"><span class="dot"></span>最终转写确认<time>'+clockBase+':03</time></div><div class="event-line"><span class="dot"></span>文字已写入<time>'+clockBase+':03</time></div><div class="event-line"><span class="dot"></span>实际播放完成<time>'+clockBase+':14</time></div><div class="divider"></div>'+btn('查看本轮技术详情','round-detail','wide','file')+'<p class="muted" style="font-size:10px;margin-top:12px">示例时间线只用于预览展示方式。</p></div></aside></div>';return head('对话中心','用户说了什么、机器人实际回应了什么，都有据可查。',btn('导出示例','export','','download'))+'<div class="toolbar"><select aria-label="筛选家庭" id="chat-family">'+['林的家','周的家'].map(function(x){return '<option'+(chatFamilySel===x?' selected':'')+'>'+x+'</option>';}).join('')+'</select><select aria-label="筛选设备" id="chat-device">'+['全部设备',U.state.name,'圆圆'].map(function(x){return '<option'+(chatDeviceSel===x?' selected':'')+'>'+e(x)+'</option>';}).join('')+'</select><select aria-label="筛选时间" id="chat-period">'+['最近7天','今天','昨天'].map(function(x){return '<option'+(chatPeriodSel===x?' selected':'')+'>'+x+'</option>';}).join('')+'</select><span class="spacer"></span><label class="state-switch">预览页面状态 <select id="chat-state" aria-label="预览页面状态">'+[['normal','正常内容'],['empty','无结果'],['sync','同步中'],['error','保存失败'],['denied','未授权']].map(function(x){return '<option value="'+x[0]+'"'+(chatState===x[0]?' selected':'')+'>'+x[1]+'</option>';}).join('')+'</select></label></div>'+(stateBody?'<section class="panel">'+stateBody+'</section>':normal);}
function daily(){return head('每日摘要','按天浏览多段聊天，每段仍保留自己的会话边界。',btn('查看生成流程','summary-process','','tasks'))+N('每日摘要及30分钟业务会话归档尚未接入。以下展示计划中的阅读方式，内容为虚构示例。','info')+'<div class="stack mt"><div class="day-card"><div class="date-block">11月<strong>08</strong>星期日</div>'+panel('今天的陪伴','<p style="font-size:13px;line-height:2">今天聊到了第一次跑完一公里、运动后的放松，以及小狐狸和月亮的故事。一次故事讲述被插话打断，随后回答了关于月相的问题。</p><div class="pill-row" style="margin:16px 0">'+B('运动与健康','orange')+B('故事时光')+B('周末安排')+'</div><div class="row-list">'+U.sessions.slice(0,3).map(function(s){return '<a href="#/conversations" data-chat="'+s.id+'"><span class="muted small">'+s.time+'</span><div class="grow"><h3>'+s.title+'</h3><p class="muted small">'+s.rounds+'轮 · '+s.end+'</p></div>'+I('chevron')+'</a>';}).join('')+'</div>','<span class="muted small">3段聊天 · 摘要样例</span>')+'</div><div class="day-card"><div class="date-block">11月<strong>07</strong>星期六</div>'+panel('昨天的陪伴','<p class="small">一起讨论了晚饭后散步，建议先休息一会儿，再选择熟悉、平坦的路线慢走。</p><div class="divider"></div><a href="#/conversations" data-chat="dinner" class="between"><span class="small">19:42　晚饭后散步计划</span>'+I('chevron')+'</a>','<span class="muted small">1段聊天 · 摘要样例</span>')+'</div></div>';}
function memories(){return head('记忆管理','区分聊天档案、近期上下文和长期记忆。',btn('清除设备记忆','clear-memory','danger','brain'))+'<div class="grid-main"><div class="stack">'+panel('设备近期记忆','<div class="between mb"><div><h3>'+e(U.state.name)+' · 林的家</h3><p class="muted small">当前策略：最近7天，最多24轮</p></div>'+B('已接入','green')+'</div><div class="memory-card"><div class="between"><h3>运动后的放松方法</h3><span class="muted small">今天 14:33</span></div><div class="quote">用户问：“腿有一点酸，运动后应该怎么放松？”</div><p class="muted small">回复有实际播放证据，作为设备近期聊天片段使用。</p><div class="between" style="margin-top:14px"><span class="muted small">来源：第一次跑完一公里</span><a class="text-link" href="#/conversations" data-chat="run">查看原对话 '+I('arrow')+'</a></div></div><div class="memory-card" style="margin-bottom:0"><div class="between"><h3>晚饭后散步</h3><span class="muted small">昨天 19:42</span></div><div class="quote">用户提到想在晚饭后出去走一走。</div><a class="text-link" href="#/conversations" data-chat="dinner">查看来源 '+I('arrow')+'</a></div>')+panel('长期人物记忆','<div class="empty" style="padding:20px"><div class="mini-icon">'+I('people')+'</div><h3>人物记忆尚未接入</h3><p>声纹身份仍在验证。近期设备聊天不能自动视为某一位家庭成员的长期偏好。</p>'+B('规划中')+'</div>')+'</div><div class="stack">'+panel('三种数据，各有用途',D([['聊天档案','供页面检索和回看'],['设备近期记忆','供模型近期接话'],['长期记忆','经归属和来源校验的事实']])+'<div class="divider"></div>'+N('清除设备记忆不会自动删除聊天档案；删除聊天档案应联动清理相关摘要和可恢复记忆。','info'))+panel('按来源查看','<div class="row-list"><a href="#/daily">'+I('calendar')+'<span class="grow">每日聊天摘要</span>'+I('chevron')+'</a><a href="#/policies">'+I('shield')+'<span class="grow">数据与留存策略</span>'+I('chevron')+'</a></div>')+'</div></div>';}
function capCard(c){return '<article class="panel cap-card"><div class="between"><div class="cap-icon">'+I(c.icon)+'</div>'+B(c.stage,c.type)+'</div><h2>'+c.name+'</h2><p>'+c.desc+'</p><div class="cap-foot"><span class="muted" style="font-size:10px">'+c.detail+'</span><a class="text-link" href="#/'+c.route+'" aria-label="查看'+c.name+'详情">'+I('arrow')+'</a></div></article>';}
function capabilities(){var data=U.capabilities.filter(function(c){return capFilter==='全部'||c.stage===capFilter;});return head('能力中心','真实展示每项能力的实现阶段、设备支持与验证状态。',btn('能力说明','cap-help','','info'))+'<div class="toolbar"><div class="segmented">'+['全部','已接入','验证中','未接入','待开发'].map(function(x){return '<button data-cap-filter="'+x+'" class="'+(x===capFilter?'active':'')+'">'+x+'</button>';}).join('')+'</div><span class="spacer"></span><span class="muted small">'+data.length+' 项能力</span></div><div class="grid-3">'+data.map(capCard).join('')+'</div>';}
var emotions=[['neutral','平静'],['happy','开心'],['loving','喜爱'],['embarrassed','害羞'],['confident','自信'],['relaxed','放松'],['confused','疑惑'],['surprised','惊讶'],['delicious','馋嘴'],['silly','搞怪'],['winking','眨眼'],['sad','难过'],['sleepy','困倦'],['crying','哭泣'],['angry','生气']];
function expressions(){var emo=emotions.find(function(x){return x[0]===expression;});return head('表情预览','CHICK-01 小鸡方案 · L0状态、L1情绪、L2本地动画。',B('15种主情绪','orange'))+'<div class="grid-main"><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><h2>设备屏幕示意</h2><span class="muted small">示意绘制，非固件逐帧仿真</span></div><div class="expression-stage">'+U.face(expression,expressionMode==='说话')+'<span style="font-size:13px;color:#766449">'+({'待机':'待机中','聆听':'正在聆听','思考':'正在思考','说话':'正在说话'})[expressionMode]+'</span></div><div class="segmented" style="margin-top:20px">'+['待机','聆听','思考','说话'].map(function(x){return '<button data-expression-mode="'+x+'" class="'+(x===expressionMode?'active':'')+'">'+x+'</button>';}).join('')+'</div><div class="divider"></div><h3 class="mb">选择情绪 · '+emo[1]+'</h3><div class="expression-options">'+emotions.map(function(x){return '<button class="btn '+(x[0]===expression?'active':'')+'" data-expression="'+x[0]+'">'+x[1]+'</button>';}).join('')+'</div></section><div class="stack">'+panel('三层怎样配合','<div class="timeline"><div class="timeline-item"><h3>L0 · 设备正在做什么</h3><p class="muted">真实系统状态触发，配中文文字。</p></div><div class="timeline-item"><h3>L1 · 回应表达什么情绪</h3><p class="muted">模型选择，绑定当前回复，实际播放后生效。</p></div><div class="timeline-item"><h3>L2 · 脸自然地动起来</h3><p class="muted">本地眨眼、微动作，嘴型随实际播放活动变化。</p></div></div>')+N('情绪名称仅在管理预览中显示。设备上的L1情绪和L2微动作不添加名称文字。','info')+'</div></div>';}
